<title>USA: U.S. interest rates mixed in latest week.</title>
<headline>U.S. interest rates mixed in latest week.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve announced average interest rates for the week ended Sept 27, compared with the Sept 20 week, as follows:</p>
<p>   Federal funds rate.................5.34 vs 5.22</p>
<p>   3-month Treasury bills.............4.98 vs 5.12</p>
<p>   3-month commercial paper...........5.52 vs 5.52</p>
<p>   3-month bankers acceptances........5.34 vs 5.39</p>
<p>   3-month CDs........................5.49 vs 5.49</p>
<p>   3-month Eurodollar.................5.48 vs 5.48</p>
<p>   30-year Government bond............6.95 vs 7.01</p>
</text>
